  "title": "Cross-version rollback with token clock skew and migration epoch drift",
  "context": "A partial rollback moves the north API back to an old schema, while a job token verifier observes clock skew and a west writer lags the schema migration epoch. Some customer paths and writes remain up due to redundancy; an aggregated status alert is misleading.",
